<v Sarah Koenig>WBEZ management oversight from our boss Mr. Torey Malatia. Who, when I told him Ira was away, finally saw his chance to get us to stop talking about him on the show.
<v Sarah Koenig>WBEZ管理监督来自我们的老板托里·马拉蒂亚先生。他，当我告诉他艾拉不在时，终于看到了机会，让我们停止在节目中谈论他。

00:57:09.280 --> 00:57:12.630
<v Julie Snyder>It's just that like I don't really like people knowing my business.
<v Julie Snyder>只是我真的不喜欢别人知道我的私事。

